Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One - mé po to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seinem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-person at the Mog impossible 여is een
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mandrijs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be afraid of the fear of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't care about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't know what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the while, the kid and I\Nwere just sitting on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phantomon showed up and\Nthings got very intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari told the creep that\Nshe was the eighth child
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that she'd go with him\Nif he'd leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I going to explain this to Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't give yourself up to Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy you and gain\Ncontrol of both worlds. Kari, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai asked me to protect\Nher, and I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me there are two\Nthings you can do about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number one, you can stand there and\Nbeat yourself up about the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or number two, we can\Nfind a way to rescue Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The convention center is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where my parents\Nare being held prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And keep an eye out for Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Gatomon, is this the eighth child?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love this, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done the eighth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you dust it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he do it? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that? It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have no use for\Nthese little brats anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do with them, oh, evil one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make them go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to deal with them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon, where could he be going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't stand a ghost of a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you made it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon put them under some kind of\Nspell since he found the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he's got Kari. Huh? Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's Matt and Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, sir, the\Ntechnical name is Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're not like the pretend\Nmonsters you've seen in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those old movies destroying a\Nbunch of Japanese cities Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, maybe that's a\Nbad example But anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digimon Matt's riding\Non is definitely on our side
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are good Digimon and\Nbad Digimon The good Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are our friends Just like Tentomon here\NI'm more than good, I'm exceptional
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare doubt ya
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Joe, why does Wizardmon\Nhave a tag in a crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it belonged to\Nthe 8th Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it could be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you awake? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? I'm TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. Kari! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Kari? Kari? Who's Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to give this crest to Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you want us to give\Nthat to Ty's little sister, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we have to deliver the\Ncrest to Tai's sister, Kari,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that must mean she's the eighth Digi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-Destined child we've been\Nlooking for all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm always the last one to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari and Gatomon need this crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she's one of the bad Digimon\Nthat works for Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that Gatomon\Nis one of the good guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt! Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Matt's Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did your vote from Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's you? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, TK! Hey, Matt! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw all that stuff on television,\NI just couldn't stay home anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom wanted to come too,\Nbut we couldn't bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wizardmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was attacked by Myotismon, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if she was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lilimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon's a good Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got the Tag and Crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, he could be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Sora. It's all true. Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tag and crest belong to Kari. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to help Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was captured by\NMyotismon. Gatomon? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon said Gatomon\Nbelongs with Kari. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where is Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chennai sent me some email a little\Nwhile ago if I recall correctly he said
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the TV station is the center of my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otis mon's fog barrier it's my Otis mon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scott got oh. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head for\Nthe viewing platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'll show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this battle to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can handle these Digi-Clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wizardmon, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me give you a hand. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you, my pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your little cat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little girl, why have you\Nchosen to show yourself to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what's\Nabout to happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you were hurting all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone had to stop you from\Nhurting innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, what a thoughtful little girl you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got who, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you look at\Nthe 8th child's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she's not the\N8th child. Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! Kari! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting that you know her name\Nsince you've never met her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up here! Got it, Dad! Wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Digimon, he'll fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together again. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad it'll be short-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grizzly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centarumon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting a little noisy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find some place quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am really getting sick of that laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:12:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you! Get Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WereGarurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's got to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, here. Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wizarmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're still alive? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than the\Nlikes of you to destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Wizard Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now give that to me, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a request. Wait! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just picked on the wrong\Nguy's little sister, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fangface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikari! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can thank me after you\Ntake over the world, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get them, Phantomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offices, offices. The champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon, Digimon Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the Digivolve to MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shiny nano
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falcon's Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We invade!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's strong. Too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you done? I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a fake hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you had enough or\Ndo you want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was about to\Nask you the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night Raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't get in my way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:17:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Wizardmon, you're gonna be\Nalright. Please don't leave, Wizardmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Gatomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me I'm sorry About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I got you involved\Nin this Don't be sorry I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met you, my life\Nwould have had no meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you and I were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Kari's Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not her, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the drunk girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:18:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the drunk girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gokimon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Endo Ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anjohomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon is an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anjohomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon, you've tried to destroy the Digi\NDestined and attempted to conquer Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In doing so, you have ruined the\Nlives of Digimon and humans alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you justify yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to explain\Nmyself to the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my destiny to plunge this world into
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,darkness and become king\Nof the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no angel or Digimon\Nhas the power to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otis Moth, don't you have any\Nregrets for the things you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Employee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also friends to the boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power. It's… it's growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, give your power to Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hammer Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wing Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand of faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon is gone! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nbefore we're crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we finally\Ndestroyed Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so tough\Nafter all. Great. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully now the real\Nworld will return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting thicker. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Myotismon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's still out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we just made him stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tobi, Tetsuo, Yuuki wo wo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Te kokoro no hame hiroge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Te mada minu mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E ima kara kate shi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nai Sola e mukate Mada
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hajimata bakari sa. Yume
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,En vokken. La la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the game adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.36,0:22:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venom Phantomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the game has changed.

